  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n L\n M\n N\n \n \n\n **Means**\n +\n -\n ×\n \n \n\nLet's check,\n\n**67 L 50 M 15 N 6 = 27**\n\n→ 67 + 50 - **15 ****×**** 6** = 27\n\n→ **67 +**** 50** - 90 = 27\n\n→ 117 - 90 = 27\n\n→ 27 = 27\n\n**100 L 50 M 13 N 5 = 85**\n\n→ 100 + 50 - **13 × 5 **= 85\n\n→ **100 +**** 50** - 65 = 85\n\n→ 150 - 65 = 85\n\n→ 85 = 85\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**6 L 8 M 4 N 3 = ?**\n\n→ 6 + 8 - **4 × 3** = ?\n\n→ **6 +**** 8** - 12 = ?\n\n→ 14 - 12 = 2\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
